# Generated by @napi-rs/cli on every `napi build` invocation.
# These artefacts are platform-specific binaries and must NOT
# be committed:
#
#   - kmail-sdk-native.${platform}-${arch}.node  — the loaded addon
#   - index.js                                   — the dispatch shim
#   - index.d.ts                                 — TypeScript types
#
# Downstream consumers (the desktop app, the future @kmail/sdk-native
# npm publish) get these from the sdk-build-napi.yml CI matrix or
# from running `napi build` locally.
*.node
index.js
index.d.ts

# Node deps from `npm install @napi-rs/cli` in this crate.
node_modules/
